    "sentence_translations": [
      "Mistaken Tones",
      "",
      "In the hospital waiting room, a group of patients were waiting for their urine tests.",
      "Each of them had their own urine sample in their hands.",
      "",
      "One by one, the nurse called out the patients' names.",
      "One of the patients was called Wang Shangju.",
      "When the nurse called out “Wang Shangju”, the patients in the waiting room all heard “lift up”.",
      "Although they all felt it strange, they lifted up their urine samples in the air.",
      "",
      "The nurse noticed that the patient Wang Shangju didn't reply, so she called for “Wang Shangju” again.",
      "The patients lifted up their urine samples even higher.",
      "",
      "At this moment, Wang Shangju realized that the nurse called for him, and replied in a loud voice: “Here!”",
      "",
      "The other patients heard “pour”, and unwillingly took their urine samples and poured them out on the floor.",
      ""
    ]
  }
